{{!
    @template mod_flashcard/decks

    The Leitner deck table: one tile per deck, hardest first. A tile shows how many
    cards are left and whether the deck is due (primary button), already reviewed
    (outline button) or empty. The look lives in theme_nit
    (scss/components/_flashcard.scss).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * decks - [{number, title, count, strdeck, isempty, isdue, isreviewed, waitlabel, stack, playurl, playlabel}]
      A reviewed deck has a waitlabel and, for students, no playurl: it opens at its review time.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "decks": [
            {"number": 1, "title": "Hard set", "count": 3, "strdeck": "Remains : 3 card(s)",
             "isdue": true, "stack": [true, true, true], "playurl": "#", "playlabel": "Learn with that deck"},
            {"number": 2, "title": "Easy set", "count": 0, "strdeck": "Remains : 0 card(s)",
             "isempty": true, "stack": []}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="nit-fc nit-fc-decks">
    <div class="nit-fc-deckgrid">
        {{#decks}}
        <section class="nit-fc-deck{{#isdue}} is-due{{/isdue}}{{#isreviewed}} is-reviewed{{/isreviewed}}{{#isempty}} is-empty{{/isempty}}">
            <header class="nit-fc-deck__head">
                <span class="nit-fc-deck__num">{{number}}</span>
                <div class="nit-fc-deck__title" role="heading" aria-level="3">{{title}}</div>
            </header>

            <div class="nit-fc-deck__pile" aria-hidden="true">
                {{#stack}}<span class="nit-fc-deck__sheet"></span>{{/stack}}
                <span class="nit-fc-deck__count">{{count}}</span>
            </div>

            <p class="nit-fc-deck__meta">{{strdeck}}</p>
            <p class="nit-fc-deck__state">
                {{#isdue}}{{#str}}deckdue, mod_flashcard{{/str}}{{/isdue}}
                {{#isreviewed}}{{#str}}deckreviewed, mod_flashcard{{/str}}{{/isreviewed}}
                {{#isempty}}{{#str}}deckempty, mod_flashcard{{/str}}{{/isempty}}
            </p>
            {{#waitlabel}}
            <p class="nit-fc-deck__wait"><span aria-hidden="true">&#9201;</span> {{waitlabel}}</p>
            {{/waitlabel}}

            {{#playurl}}
            <a class="btn {{#isdue}}btn-primary{{/isdue}}{{^isdue}}btn-outline-primary{{/isdue}} nit-fc-deck__go" href="{{playurl}}">{{playlabel}}</a>
            {{/playurl}}
        </section>
        {{/decks}}
    </div>
</div>
